outputs/temp/
outputs/predictions/
outputs/overlays/
outputs/iceberg_states/
outputs/error_analysis/
outputs/experiments/
**/outputs/temp/
**/outputs/predictions/
**/outputs/overlays/
**/outputs/iceberg_states/
**/outputs/error_analysis/
**/outputs/experiments/

# --- Logs & Profiling ---
*.log
logs/
**/logs/
wandb/
runs/
lightning_logs/

